  }
}
```
So `.reactions` contains `.reactions__list` and `.reactions__trigger`. `[open]` somewhere inside (details). When no reactions: list hidden, trigger gets a filled background. When reactions exist: list shown, trigger maybe border-only.

```
.reactions__trigger {
  --btn-size: var(--reaction-size);
  --btn-border-color: var(--reaction-border-color);
  img { block-size: 65%; inline-size: 65%; }
}
